import scene_models.dl
import scene_placements.dl

UI scene pose list means: the type of (an empty list of UI scene pose)
UI scene material list means: the type of (an empty list of UI scene material)
UI scene placement list means: the type of (an empty list of UI scene placement)
UI scene flag list means: the type of (an empty list of a boolean)

class:
    patterns:
        UI scene instance
    members:
        model as UI scene model
        poses as UI scene pose list
        materials as UI scene material list
        visibility as UI scene flag list
        pickability as UI scene flag list
        dirty as UI scene flag list
        placements as UI scene placement list
        root pose as UI scene pose
        anchor as graphics matrix
        extent as UI scene extent
        pending as a boolean
        revision as a 64 bit integer

to [mark UI scene part] {integer:index} [changed in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance}:
    replace item at index index in (instance's dirty) with true
    set instance's pending to true

to [mark UI scene roots changed in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance}:
    set index to 0
    for each part in (instance's model's parts):
        if part's parent = -1:
            mark UI scene part index changed in instance
        increment index

to [set UI scene anchor in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance} [to] {UI scene transform:transform}:
    set changed to false
    loop index from 0 to 16:
        if (the item at index in (instance's anchor)) != (the item at index in (transform's matrix)):
            set changed to true
    if changed = false:
        return nothing
    set instance's anchor to transform's matrix
    mark UI scene roots changed in instance

to [set UI scene pose of part] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance} [to] {UI scene pose:pose}:
    if (the item at index in (instance's poses)) is the same UI scene pose as pose:
        return nothing
    replace item at index index in (instance's poses) with pose
    mark UI scene part index changed in instance

to [set UI scene material of part] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance} [to] {UI scene material:material}:
    require UI scene material material
    if (the item at index in (instance's materials)) is the same UI scene material as material:
        return nothing
    replace item at index index in (instance's materials) with material
    mark UI scene part index changed in instance

to [set UI scene flag] {boolean:value} [at part] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to a list:flags} [of] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance}:
    if (the item at index in flags) = value:
        return nothing
    replace item at index index in flags with value
    mark UI scene part index changed in instance

to [set UI scene visibility of part] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance} [to] {boolean:visible}:
    set UI scene flag visible at part index in (instance's visibility) of instance

to [set UI scene pickability of part] {integer:index} [in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance} [to] {boolean:pickable}:
    set UI scene flag pickable at part index in (instance's pickability) of instance

to [set UI scene root pose in] {a pointer to UI scene instance:instance} [to] {UI scene pose:pose}:
    if instance's root pose is the same UI scene pose as pose:
        return nothing
    set instance's root pose to pose
    mark UI scene roots changed in instance
